---
// TrustBar.astro: Core value pillars, certifications, guarantees, insurance & response times
---

<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm py-6 sm:py-8 border-y border-outline-variant/30">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-margin sm:px-margin-md space-y-6">
    
    <!-- 4 Main Trust Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- 1. Response Time Promise -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/60 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:border-secondary/30 transition-all">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm mt-0.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">alarm</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-extrabold">Arrivée en 30 Min</span>
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-snug">
            <strong>Promesse temps réel :</strong> Moins de 30 min sur Arlon 6700 et 20-35 min communes voisines. Astreinte 24h/24 & 7j/7.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Years in business -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/60 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm mt-0.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">history_edu</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-extrabold">15+ Ans de Métier</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-snug">
            <strong>Établi depuis 2009 :</strong> Plus de 3 800 chantiers et dépannages d'urgence réalisés dans le Sud-Luxembourg.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. All Certifications -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/60 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm mt-0.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">workspace_premium</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-extrabold">100% Certifié</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-snug">
            <strong>Toutes certifications :</strong> Agréé CSTC, Région Wallonne G1/G2/L, Belgaqua eau potable & RESCert.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Insurance & Guarantees -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/60 border border-outline-variant/20 hover:border-emerald-600/30 transition-all">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm mt-0.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">verified_user</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-primary font-extrabold">Garantie & Assurance AXA</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5 leading-snug">
            <strong>Garantie décennale 10 ans :</strong> RC Pro AXA (Police n° 730.456.789). Agréé Ethias, AXA, AG, Baloise.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Guarantees & Certifications Badge Ribbon -->
    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-on-surface">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 font-semibold text-primary">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xs">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]">verified</span>
          <span>RC Pro & Décennale 10 Ans (AXA Belgium)</span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xs">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]">military_tech</span>
          <span>Agréé CSTC & Région Wallonne (G1/G2/L)</span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xs">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]">health_and_safety</span>
          <span>Certifié Belgaqua & Normes Sanitaires</span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xs">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[16px]">timer</span>
          <span>Délai d'arrivée garanti &lt; 30 min</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-medium">
        <span>Devis écrit préalable • Pièces certifiées d'origine garanties 2 ans</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
